{"id":"vod_sn_37848","vodId":"37848","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"海月姬 ~水母公主~","name_cn":"海月姬 ~水母公主~","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/3e793888b5da83409d47f314c7edcfa0.jpg"},"summary":"仓下月海（花泽香菜 饰）是个不折不扣的宅女。而她的主攻方向还是颇为冷门的水母。梦想成为插画家的月海来到了东京，住进了女生宿舍天水馆。天水馆里面住的全部是宅女，她们各有各的萌点和爱好。管理员千绘子（齐藤贵美子 饰）喜欢做人偶；玛雅雅（冈村明美 饰）则是个三国爱好者；邦巴则 热衷铁道；吉吉（能登麻美子 饰）则是中老年男性控……天水馆成了她们的小家和小天堂。而另一边鯉淵蔵之介（斋藤弥月 饰）则出身名门，但不想继承家业的他，以女装打扮，梦想成为服装设计师。宅女和伪娘的故事就此拉开了序幕……　　本作改编自东村明子的同名漫画。该漫画曾获得2010年第34届讲谈社漫画赏少女部门赏。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:56:06","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/A6ZqS3fYvX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8hnGLZJ5rR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vUDXMMs5et1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/L9t4xFFJ1V1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TTKPSF3Rsa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/E1LDHjyLCv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Y9Yk39EKhB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3dLRPCKkva1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ebna2tiwmq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Y7iLQJkFbh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EvGdYuvVBi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0UjXtHRkUQ1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:06.069Z"}